msgctxt "64"
msgid "Um, excuse me. Did you have your fortune read by that fortune teller?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I overheard some people near the arcade on Nakamichi Street complaining "
"about getting cheated out of their money by that fortune teller."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I don't know all the details, but they said something about her charging a "
"lot of money and then just spouting off some generic babble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"They're probably still there. Why don't you try going to the arcade on "
"Nakamichi Street and talking to them yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"(More people swindled by that fortune teller? I better go to the video "
"arcade on Nakamichi Street.)"
msgstr ""

